  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "b3_u07_l1_g1",
      "pattern": "A/V-(으)ㄹ까요? (taxmin)",
      "meaning_uz": "...arkin? ...armikin? (o'ylab so'rash)",
      "meaning_en": "I wonder if … ? (speculating)",
      "explanation_md": "1-kitobda **-(으)ㄹ까요?** \"...aylikmi?\" (taklif) edi. Bu yerda u **taxmin** so'raydi: gapiruvchi o'zi ham bilmaydi va suhbatdoshning fikrini so'raydi — \"**...arkin?**\", \"**...armikin?**\".\n\n**환영회에 사람이 많이 올까요?** — *Kechaga odam ko'p kelarmikin?*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi (1-kitobdagidek)\n\n- 받침siz → **-ㄹ까요?**: 오다 → **올까요?**, 시작되다 → **시작될까요?**\n- 받침 bilan → **-을까요?**: 많다 → **많을까요?**, 괜찮다 → **괜찮을까요?**\n- **ㅂ**: 춥다 → **추울까요?**\n- O'tgan: **-았/었을까요?**: 벌써 끝났을까요? — *Allaqachon tugadimikin?*\n\n### Ikki ma'noni farqlash\n\n- **같이 갈까요?** (biz) — taklif: *birga boraylikmi?*\n- **민지 씨도 올까요?** (boshqa odam/narsa) — taxmin: *Minji ham kelarmikin?*\n\n### Javob\n\n**네, 아마 올 거예요.** — *Ha, ehtimol keladi.* (keyingi grammatika)",
      "explanation_md_en": "In book 1, **-(으)ㄹ까요?** meant \"shall we?\". Here it asks for a **guess**: the speaker doesn't know and wants the listener's opinion — \"**I wonder if …?**\", \"**Do you think …?**\".\n\n**환영회에 사람이 많이 올까요?** — *Do you think many people will come to the party?*\n\n### How to form it (as in book 1)\n\n- No 받침 → **-ㄹ까요?**: 오다 → **올까요?**, 시작되다 → **시작될까요?**\n- With 받침 → **-을까요?**: 많다 → **많을까요?**, 괜찮다 → **괜찮을까요?**\n- **ㅂ**: 춥다 → **추울까요?**\n- Past: **-았/었을까요?**: 벌써 끝났을까요? — *Do you think it's already over?*\n\n### Telling the two apart\n\n- **같이 갈까요?** (we) — suggestion: *shall we go together?*\n- **민지 씨도 올까요?** (someone/something else) — guess: *do you think Minji will come?*\n\n### Answer\n\n**네, 아마 올 거예요.** — *Yes, she probably will.* (next grammar point)",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "받침 yo'q",
          "condition_en": "No 받침",
          "rule": "A/V + ㄹ까요?",
          "example": "올까요?, 시작될까요?"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "받침 bor",
          "condition_en": "With 받침",
          "rule": "A/V + 을까요?",
          "example": "많을까요?, 괜찮을까요?"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "O'tgan",
          "condition_en": "Past",
          "rule": "-았/었을까요?",
          "example": "끝났을까요?"
        }
      ],
