  "dialogue": {
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "junho",
        "ko": "아지즈 씨, 금요일에 신입생 환영회에 갈 거예요?",
        "uz": "Aziz, juma kuni birinchi kurslar kechasiga borasizmi?",
        "en": "Aziz, are you going to the freshman welcome party on Friday?",
        "audio": "a66ffc6074eb.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "가고 싶은데 좀 걱정돼요. 사람이 많이 올까요?",
        "uz": "Bormoqchiman-u, lekin xavotirdaman. Odam ko'p kelarmikin?",
        "en": "I'd like to, but I'm a bit nervous. Do you think lots of people will come?",
        "audio": "69ccce208d39.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "junho",
        "ko": "네, 아마 신입생하고 선배들이 다 올 거예요.",
        "uz": "Ha, ehtimol birinchi kurslar ham, kattalar ham kelsa kerak.",
        "en": "Yes, probably all the freshmen and seniors will come.",
        "audio": "60a348886298.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "저는 모르는 사람이 많아서 어색할 것 같아요.",
        "uz": "Men notanish odamlar ko'p bo'lgani uchun noqulay his qilsam kerak.",
        "en": "I don't know many people, so I think it'll be awkward.",
        "audio": "f99f7f5066b7.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "junho",
        "ko": "처음에는 어색할 거예요. 그런데 게임을 하면 금방 친해질 거예요.",
        "uz": "Avvaliga noqulay bo'lsa kerak. Lekin o'yin o'ynasak, tez yaqinlashib ketamiz.",
        "en": "It'll probably be awkward at first. But once we play games, we'll get close fast.",
        "audio": "c97525f4cf02.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "환영회에서 자기소개도 해야 돼요?",
        "uz": "Kechada o'zimni tanishtirishim ham kerakmi?",
        "en": "Do I have to introduce myself at the party?",
        "audio": "7979ab8fdfbc.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "junho",
        "ko": "네, 아마 한 명씩 할 거예요. 짧게 하면 돼요.",
        "uz": "Ha, ehtimol bittadan. Qisqa qilsa bo'ladi.",
        "en": "Yes, probably one by one. A short one is fine.",
        "audio": "e4938f1dd204.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "참가비가 있을까요?",
        "uz": "Ishtirok to'lovi bormikin?",
        "en": "Do you think there's a fee?",
        "audio": "24ca7195e956.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "junho",
        "ko": "과대표가 만 원쯤일 거라고 했어요.",
        "uz": "Kurs sardori o'n ming vonga yaqin bo'lsa kerak dedi.",
        "en": "The class rep said it'll probably be around 10,000 won.",
        "audio": "c52fe950fbd4.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "그럼 같이 가요. 준호 씨가 있으면 괜찮을 거예요.",
        "uz": "Unda birga boraylik. Junho, siz bo'lsangiz, yaxshi bo'lsa kerak.",
        "en": "Then let's go together. It'll be fine if you're there, Junho.",
        "audio": "77c6e3b8d895.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "junho",
        "ko": "좋아요! 금요일 여섯 시에 학생회관 앞에서 만나요.",
        "uz": "Zo'r! Juma kuni soat oltida talabalar uyi oldida uchrashamiz.",
        "en": "Great! Let's meet in front of the student union at six on Friday.",
        "audio": "cbca6759771e.mp3"
      }
    ]
  },
